this is where our acting abilities are  truly tested  while the maze runner may be a dark and  gritty trilogy  the onset antics were anything but  working long hours on set across  multiple movies builds strong bonds  [Applause]  it's easy to tell the cast of maze  runner loves spending time together from  the hilarious outtakes  and behind the scenes footage of them  goofing up or killing time on set  bloopers gag reel the desert landscapes  in the scorch trials look amazing  because they were filmed on location  but filming in the deserts of  albuquerque new mexico was no easy feat  ki hong li who plays minnow describes  the challenges they faced  trying to climb sand dunes and fighting  strong winds to keep their eyes open  and keep their balance i mean it's hard  to you know sprint up a  crazy incline of a sand dude and then  get up there and look cool  dylan o'brien and thomas freddy sangster  who play thomas and newt  seem to have a running joke that began  during the filming of the first maze  runner movie  they plan to surprise the rest of the  crew by kissing in the middle of filming  a scene  dylan backed out at the last second but  it wasn't the last time the two would  pull that particular prank  they know all about newt miss or the  part of the maze runner fandom that  ships thomas and newt  romantically and they seem pretty cool  with it  [Music]  really it's a really sweet relationship  i think they have dylan and thomas were  hardly the only pranksters on set  during the first maze runner movie will  poulter galley  secretly wrote fake love letters to  dexter darden frypan  signing them anonymously wow  he would stick them in dexter's pockets  on set while he wasn't looking  it had him totally baffled according to  blake cooper  every time dexter would take off his top  suit he would find these letters  he was so confused and had no idea who  was sending them to him  he was an old friend in the scorch  trials  the glader's escape from the facility is  nearly foiled by a door that refuses  them access  while they desperately try to get it  open the tension is high  as thomas and the others hold off jansen  and his security detail  until freedom is finally within their  grasp however  dylan key and the others could not keep  it together despite filming such a tense  scene  laughing and cracking jokes as they  fumbled with the keycard  this scene from the death cure where  thomas newton galley captured teresa and  sneak into wicked headquarters would  have gone a lot differently if thomas  had as much trouble with the wicked  securities gear as dylan o'brien did  with his props and costume  the masks worn by wicked security force  seemed to restrict the wearer's field of  vision  leading to some clumsy moments that  landed in the movie's gag reel  nothing is quite as distracting as food  when you're in the middle of a busy  filming schedule  what does everyone want from mcdonald's  in the middle of this scene in the death  cure where jorge is giving some vital  exposition about the last city  if that city is still standing that's  the last place you want to go here mom  the take is interrupted when someone  walks into the take with a tray of food  giancarlo esposito breaks character and  the whole scene  immediately derails maybe it was takeout  from los poyos hermanos  and that's why he was so tempted i want  a piece please bring over here  to stay pumped for all those  high-intensity action sequences or just  to have some fun between takes  dylan o'brien loved dancing on set  sometimes he got other cast members to  join in on the fun  and even the person behind the camera  this clip of the gladers doing a  choreographed dance together is a fan  favorite  with lots of edited clips setting the  dance to various different songs  hey baby thomas brody sangster  and dylan o'brien like to have fun with  takes they know aren't making the final  cut  you boys coming or what  in an interview dylan said being on set  was like a sketch show and he's always  trying to get thomas to crack  up thomas wasn't the only cast member to  fall victim to o'brien's comedic improv  either  it speaks to his skill as an actor that  even when cracking a joke he stays in  character  long after everyone else is burst into  laughter what's with the rap man  i don't know what i think he's on gaming  after arriving in london for part of the  death cure press tour  thomas ditched dylan at the airport  since thomas is from england going  through customs didn't take as long as  it did for his american co-star  thomas unceremoniously left dylan behind  sending him a text that he was already  in a car on the way to his hotel while  poor dylan was still being processed in  customs hey man uh  sorry i already got through into the car  um i'll see you tomorrow  guess we're not hanging out today  filming on location in baton rouge  louisiana for scenes in the glades was  no picnic  in fact it was full of snakes in fact a  snake wrangler was brought on board to  keep the actors and the animals safe  jacob lattimore who plays jeff had a  close encounter with one when he nearly  dropped his hat on the ground while  filming  and spotted a snake on the ground nearby  had he actually dropped it  jacob told j14 i would have said goodbye  to the hat because there was no way i  was going after that  how long do you think we can last snakes  weren't the only wildlife that disrupted  the sets of the maze runner trilogy  bugs got in the way of filming too blake  cooper and caia scodelario had some  insect encounters that ended up in the  gag rails for maze runner and the scorch  trials  flake and dylan bond over the fate of a  moth that flew directly into the flames  of a torch while kaya's entrance into a  dramatic scene was thrown off by a bug  flying directly into her face a moth  just flew in there and just burned it  okay in the death cure while  infiltrating wicked headquarters to  rescue minnow  the gladers set up freeing a group of  immune children along the way  dylan o'brien and kya scotillario had  trouble staying serious during this  tense exchange with kaia playfully  pouting to get a laugh out of dylan  and dylan cracking jokes about finding  minnow and leaving the immune kids  behind  all right everyone back in your cells  this was a mistake we're very sorry we  were looking for one person  you're not saved kihong is just as much  of a jokester as dylan  goofing up several takes of a scene  where teresa tries to convince mino that  her actions are for the greater good  kaya is just as bad unable to stop  herself from breaking into giggles when  she's being held down and attacked  he really shows off his excellent  comedic timing in these bloopers  don't tease me bro  nothing ruins a dramatic reveal like a  misbehaving set piece  sometimes these inanimate objects have  comedic timing that's so perfect it's  almost as if they have a mind of their  own  like in this blooper from the death cure  newt isn't to let thomas sneak off to  fight wicked all alone  punctuating the moment by confidently  opening the door to reveal that frypan  is also offering his support  well we started this together too bad  the car didn't get the memo that this  scene was supposed to make them look  cool  sometimes props can mess up a perfectly  good take kaya seems to struggle with  medical equipment  in particular in these bloopers from the  death cure wrestling with a syringe with  a bendy needle  and a sticky glove that just won't leave  her alone  luckily she was able to pull it together  and handle medical equipment like a pro  for the final cut  who do you think the funniest member of  the maze runner's cast is  did you fart tell us your vote in the  comments and don't forget to hit  like if any of these got you to smile  if you want more maze runner content  feel free to subscribe  what about your pre-production training  i didn't go through this  i'm like a bed i wanna fly away
 

